# Revisions git blame should skip — bulk, mechanical reformats that would
# otherwise attribute every line to a formatting commit.
#
# Enable locally with:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# GitHub honours this file automatically in its blame view.
#
# After committing the one-shot `black` reformat of the tree, add its full
# 40-char commit SHA on its own line below (with a trailing comment):
#
#   <sha>  # apply black to the entire codebase
